00:34:09.000 --> 00:34:29.000
And what that creates is this really interesting, quirky thing, which is that adults are kind of, in order to interact with their kids, kind of take on a childlike mentality. So they will kind of become their zany, play a friend, and play pretend with them the way other children would do. But the problem is I'm an adult. Number one, I'm not good at it. And number two, I don't particularly enjoy it.

